# Physics-based command conditioning (pcomp.h): circles at 0.5 m/s, R20 at
# mid-span (12.5 m/s^2 centripetal, where the head is softest), as planned
# and then conditioned: a ZV shaper at the model's head modes, a 20 ms
# moving average, the shrink of both and the head's deflection fed forward
# (the drives' own lag needs no term since vel_int0.mode 1 and vel1.bc 1:
# servo 0). Without it the carriage follows exactly and the head bends
# outwards by a/w^2 (~0.4 mm); with it the contour error drops about nine-
# fold. The conditioning's delay (~24 ms) is reported for delaying the
# machine's I/O.
@program portal/portal_sim
@args portal/machine/portal.portal
run 0.05
lcnc 1
run 0.2
move 0.5 520 500
run 0.3
circle 0.3 500 500 20 1.2
mark
circle 1.0 500 500 20 4
print max_econt max_hy
move 0.3 520 500
run 0.3
comp shaper 1
comp jerk 20
comp shrink 1
comp defl 1
comp servo 0
run 0.2
circle 0.3 500 500 20 1.2
mark
circle 1.0 500 500 20 4
print max_econt max_hy comp_delay fault
@expect portal.max_econt[1] > 600
@expect portal.max_econt[2] < 120
@expect portal.comp_delay ~ 24 2
@expect portal.fault == 0
@reject ^ERROR
